ll,"updated":1793750400000,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":17,"fontFamily":5,"text":"Web IQ is the fourth pillar - and it is not the Web Search tool","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Web IQ is the fourth pillar - and it is not the Web Search tool","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"_2sWXpT9TQ6uq0sUhsVic","type":"text","x":1238.0,"y":171.75,"width":1038.53,"height":80.0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["_orQATq72wxRfvF2gj0jZ"],"frameId":null,"index":"aF","roundness":null,"seed":94136487,"version":2,"versionNonce":1772917821,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1793750400000,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":16,"fontFamily":5,"text":"Web IQ is a separate API service (REST + MCP at api.microsoft.ai/v3) with its own Learn area and portal. It is NOT the Foundry\nWeb Search tool and NOT Grounding with Bing: different endpoint, billing and compliance. Foundry's table of contents lists only\nFoundry IQ, Fabric IQ (preview) and Work IQ (preview), so Web IQ reaches Foundry as an MCP tool, inside a Toolbox, or as an MCP\nknowledge source in a Foundry IQ knowledge base.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Web IQ is a separate API service (REST + MCP at api.microsoft.ai/v3) with its own Learn area and portal. It is NOT the Foundry\nWeb Search tool and NOT Grounding with Bing: different endpoint, billing and compliance. Foundry's table of contents lists only\nFoundry IQ, Fabric IQ (preview) and Work IQ (preview), so Web IQ reaches Foundry as an MCP tool, inside a Toolbox, or as an MCP\nknowledge source in a Foundry IQ knowledge base.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"hzoLcoXjm_DJHoCLcXALa","type":"text","x":1238.0,"y":269.75,"width":135.86,"height":15.0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1971c2","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyl